    <md:title>9.6.1: Evaluating Expressions</md:title>
    <md:uuid>d672c834-1e36-4b02-9586-a663b32116bc</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Each expression represents two numbers. Evaluate the expressions and find the <emphasis>two</emphasis> numbers.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><title>Warm Up Activity</title><exercise data-content-id="3367bcd2-5353-4c00-b027-056a5d3e866e"><problem><para>
      <para>\(1 \pm\sqrt{49}\)</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>["\\(8\\)", "\\(-6\\)"]</para><para>
      <para>The correct answers are: 8, -6.</para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
